zinc-500\">Shopify → Facebook Catalog (CSV) — Cloudflare Ready</p></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><a href=\"/story-map\" class=\"text-xs px-3 py-1.5 bg-zinc-900 text-white rounded-full font-medium\">Story Map</a><a href=\"/validate\" class=\"text-xs px-3 py-1.5 border rounded-full font-medium\">Validate</a><a href=\"/editor\" class=\"text-xs px-3 py-1.5 bg-violet-600 text-white rounded-full font-medium\">Open HTML Editor →</a><a href=\"https://developers.facebook.com/docs/commerce-platform/catalog/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-xs text-zinc-500 hover:text-zinc-900 underline\">Meta Catalog Docs</a></div></div></header><main class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-8 space-y-8\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl border p-6 shadow-sm space-y-4\"><h2 class=\"font-medium\">1. Connect Shopify Store</h2><p class=\"text-sm text-zinc-600\">Paste any Shopify storefront URL. We fetch <code class=\"bg-zinc-100 px-1 py-0.5 rounded text-xs\">/products.json</code> (public) — no API key needed for MVP. Test with <span class=\"font-mono\">store.gibun.at</span> (36 products, ~10 workshops filtered).</p><div class=\"flex gap-3\"><input placeholder=\"store.gibun.at\" class=\"flex-1 rounded-lg border px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-mono bg-white\" value=\"store.gibun.at\"/><button class=\"rounded-lg bg-zinc-900 text-white px-6 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium disabled:opacity-40 hover:bg-black transition\">Preview Products</button></div><div class=\"flex gap-2 text-xs\"><button class=\"underline text-zinc-600\">store.gibun.at</button><span class=\"text-zinc-300\">|</span><span class=\"text-zinc-400\">Try: allbirds.com, gymshark.com (any Shopify with /products.json)</span></div></div><div class=\"text-center py-12 text-sm text-zinc-500\">Enter a Shopify domain and click Preview — or just press Preview to test <code class=\"bg-zinc-100 px-1 rounded\">store.gibun.at</code>.</div></main><footer class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-8 text-xs text-zinc-400 flex gap-4\"><span>MVP scope: Shopify public <code>/products.json</code> → Facebook CSV. No edits — sync is source of truth.</span><a href=\"/validate\" class=\"underline\">Validate</a><a href=\"/story-map\" class=\"underline\">Story Map</a><a href=\"/board\" class=\"underline\">Board (old)</a></footer><button class=\"fixed bottom-4 right-4 bg-zinc-900 text-white text-xs px-3 py-2 rounded-full shadow-lg\">Show onboarding</button></div><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-a3ad899a16c16c4b.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[7121,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n3:I[4581,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n4:I[1304,[],\\\"ClientPageRoot\\\"]\\n5:I[96,[\\\"974\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/page-2598fc4558da0c85.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n8:I[484,[],\\\"OutletBoundary\\\"]\\n9:\\\"$Sreact.suspense\\\"\\nb:I[484,[],\\\"ViewportBoundary\\\"]\\nd:I[484,[],\\\"MetadataBoundary\\\"]\\nf:I[7123,[],\\\"default\\\",1]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/media/22a5144ee8d83bca-s.p.woff2\\\",\\\"font\\\",{\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"font/woff2\\\"}]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/media/7d4881bb7e1bf84d-s.p.woff2\\\",\\\"font\\\",{\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"font/woff2\\\"}]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/css/54d9bf1bb822a75e.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"0:{\\\"P\\\":null,\\\"c\\\":[\\\"\\\",\\\"\\\"],\\\"q\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"i\\\":false,\\\"f\\\":[[[\\\"\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"__PAGE__\\\",{},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",4608]},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",4624],[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$1\\\",\\\"c\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"stylesheet\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"/_next/static/css/54d9bf1bb822a75e.css\\\",\\\"precedence\\\":\\\"next\\\",\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"nonce\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\"}]],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"html\\\",null,{\\\"lang\\\":\\\"en\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"__variable_246ccd __variable_c299